<title>USA: Coflexip Stena Offshore Q4 net vs loss.</title>
<headline>Coflexip Stena Offshore Q4 net vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>In French francs.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		  3.10     loss	  9.03</p>
<p> Net profit		    50     loss	   148</p>
<p> Revs			 1,468			837</p>
<p>		 YEAR</p>
<p> Shr profit		  4.99     loss	  5.94</p>
<p> Net profit		    76     loss	   102</p>
<p> Revs			 4,906		    4,062</p>
<p>(All data above millions except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q4 earnings per share US$0.60. 1996 Q4 net income $10 million on sales of $283 million.</p>
<p>Per share figures shown on diluted basis.</p>
<p>1996 year includes an exchange loss of 24.5 million French francs on convertible notes denominated in U.S. dollars</p>
<p>1996 year includes 24 million French francs of costs related to discontinuation of composites operations.</p>
